DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8876::$$$message_0064_0000_0000$$$::I'm at the archery range on the weekend.[lr]::
8877::$$$message_0064_0000_0001$$$::Not just members who want to practice use it, but the bowmen in the suburbs sometimes also rent it out.[lr]::
8878::$$$message_0064_0000_0002$$$::This is the only archery range in the city after all.::
8879::$$$message_0064_0001_0000$$$::"Excuse me."[lr]::
8880::$$$message_0064_0001_0001$$$::"Hello, Senpai."[lr]::
8881::$$$message_0064_0001_0002$$$::"Yo, Emiya. Have you finally given up and come to draw some arrows?"::
8882::$$$message_0064_0002_0000$$$::Sakura and Mitsuzuri are at the archery range.[lr]::
8883::$$$message_0064_0002_0001$$$::The two of them are still in their school uniforms. Is it before practice?::
8884::$$$message_0064_0003_0000$$$::"No, I'm unfortunately empty-handed. What are you two doing?"[lr]::
8885::$$$message_0064_0003_0001$$$::"Huh? Oh, we have practice in the afternoon, so Matou and I were just talking about our project for the kyudo club at the cultural festival."[lr]::
8886::$$$message_0064_0003_0002$$$::Oh yeah, there was talk about that.[lr]::
8887::$$$message_0064_0003_0003$$$::It's different when doing kyudo, but the kyudo club doesn't quite have a sense of unity when it comes to social activities, as they haven't decided on a project yet.::
8888::$$$message_0064_0004_0000$$$::"Please come in, Senpai. There are many things that I would like to get your advice on."[lr]::
8889::$$$message_0064_0004_0001$$$::"I see, excuse me then."::
8890::$$$message_0064_0005_0000$$$::"So. In that case, you're taking the lead as the new captain."[lr]::
8891::$$$message_0064_0005_0001$$$::"Yes, I've been thinking about that..."::
8892::$$$message_0064_0006_0000$$$::"We don't have any oppositions within the club, but it's hard to get everyone on the same page."[lr]::
8893::$$$message_0064_0006_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri sighs.[lr]::
8894::$$$message_0064_0006_0002$$$::The kyudo club isn't small.[lr]::
8895::$$$message_0064_0006_0003$$$::In the past, there were also troublemakers like me and Shinji too, so there must also be all kinds of things with the current underclassmen.[lr]::
8896::$$$message_0064_0006_0004$$$::"Yes... I don't know if I can actually pull everyone together..."[lr]::
8897::$$$message_0064_0006_0005$$$::"If it's not possible for you, it's not possible for anyone.[lr]::
8898::$$$message_0064_0006_0006$$$::It's not like Emiya or I can do anything about it directly either... But still..."::
8899::$$$message_0064_0007_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri tries to encourage her, but she's not very articulate about it. Cultural festivals are for fun, so we don't want to add onto the pressure.[lr]::
8900::$$$message_0064_0007_0001$$$::First things first...::
8901::$$$message_0064_0008_0000$$$::"Do you know what you guys are doing for your project?"[lr]::
8902::$$$message_0064_0008_0001$$$::"Not at all. We haven't even gotten there yet, because we have bigger problems. First is the sense of unity among the club members... Or rather, Matou's confidence.[lr]::
8903::$$$message_0064_0008_0002$$$::She's already fully competent as a kyudo club captain, but she doesn't have enough experience as a festival leader..."::
8904::$$$message_0064_0009_0000$$$::"...I'm ashamed... The only experience I've had having fun with everyone is at Senpai's house..."[lr]::
8905::$$$message_0064_0009_0001$$$::Sakura looks discouraged.[lr]::
8906::$$$message_0064_0009_0002$$$::...Sakura doesn't seem like she's ever let loose and had fun... Well, I'm not one to talk either.::
8907::$$$message_0064_0010_0000$$$::The three of us think hard.[lr]::
8908::$$$message_0064_0010_0001$$$::The ticking of the clock painfully cuts through the silence.[lr]::
8909::$$$message_0064_0010_0002$$$::"Well, let us know if you come up with any good ideas too, Emiya.[lr]::
8910::$$$message_0064_0010_0003$$$::We still have time."[lr]::
8911::$$$message_0064_0010_0004$$$::The morning kinda ended on a dark note.[lr]::
8912::$$$message_0064_0010_0005$$$::However... How to get Sakura to overcome her weakness, huh? Hmm...::
908896::$$$message_9064_0006_0004$$$::"Yes... I don't know if I can actually pull everyone together..."[r]::

